Clewen

Combines Qwen/Qwen3.5-9B with Cloudflare/clef-flash (Clewen-Flash), or
Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B with Cloudflare/clef (Clewen), using recovered switchable
changes and the official Clef joint schema head.
No new training has been performed. The recovered changes are an approximation,
not the original LoRA factors. Clewen is not an official Qwen/Cloudflare release.

Qwen model weights/configuration/tokenizer/processor: Qwen authors.
See LICENSE-QWEN and the pinned upstream repository in config.json.
Clef head, joint_schema_model.py and learned backbone changes: Cloudflare authors.
See LICENSE-CLEF and the pinned upstream repository in config.json.
joint_schema_model.py is copied without changes from Cloudflare and is
identical in both pinned source releases.

Added here: recovery packaging, adapter runtime, mode-switching loader,
validation, inference examples, documentation and checks.
See config.json in the complete release for pinned source revisions.
